        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Dawn — A journey to the beginning of the solar system</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  html, body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #000;\n    color: #fff;\n    font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n  }\n  .poster {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 2500px;\n    max-width: 100%;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: #000;\n    padding: 30px 0 60px 0;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .cyan { color: #35c6e8; }\n  h1.title {\n    color: #35c6e8;\n    font-style: italic;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    font-size: 76px;\n    margin: 60px 0 10px 0;\n    text-align: center;\n    letter-spacing: -1px;\n  }\n  .subtitle {\n    color: #35c6e8;\n    font-style: italic;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    font-size: 30px;\n    text-align: center;\n    margin: 0 0 20px 0;\n  }\n  .grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.05fr 1fr;\n    column-gap: 20px;\n    padding: 0 60px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .col-left, .col-right {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n  }\n  .col-center {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n  .section {\n    margin-bottom: 60px;\n  }\n  h2 {\n    color: #35c6e8;\n    font-size: 34px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    margin: 0 0 12px 0;\n  }\n  h2 .flag {\n    display: inline-block;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n    width: 46px;\n    height: 30px;\n    margin-left: 10px;\n    border: 1px solid #444;\n  }\n  .flag-de { background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #000 33%, #d00 33%, #d00 66%, #fc0 66%); }\n  .flag-us { background: repeating-linear-gradient(to bottom, #b22 0 4px, #fff 4px 8px); }\n  .flag-it { background: linear-gradient(to right, #009246 33%, #fff 33%, #fff 66%, #ce2b37 66%); }\n  p.body {\n    font-style: italic;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    font-size: 21px;\n    line-height: 1.35;\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n  .caption {\n    font-style: italic;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    border: 1px dashed #555;\n    color: #888;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    font-style: normal;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    padding: 4px;\n  }\n  .portrait {\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    width: 150px;\n    height: 150px;\n  }\n  .row {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n  }\n  .center-para {\n    font-style: italic;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    font-size: 25px;\n    line-height: 1.8;\n    text-align: center;\n    max-width: 700px;\n    margin: 40px auto 0 auto;\n  }\n  .url {\n    color: #35c6e8;\n    font-style: italic;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    font-size: 52px;\n    text-align: center;\n    margin-top: 60px;\n  }\n  .right-text { text-align: right; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"poster\">\n\n  <h1 class=\"title\">Dawn</h1>\n  <div class=\"subtitle\">A journey to the beginning of the solar system</div>\n\n  <div class=\"grid\">\n\n    <!-- LEFT COLUMN -->\n    <div class=\"col-left\">\n\n      <div class=\"section\">\n        <h2>Framing Cameras <span class=\"flag flag-de\"></span></h2>\n        <div class=\"row\">\n          <div style=\"flex: 1 1 auto; max-width: 400px;\">\n            <p class=\"body\">\n              By imaging the surfaces of Vesta and Ceres, the framing cameras will enable scientists to map the topography, albedo and color, and to determine their shapes, volumes, and spin rates.\n            </p>\n            <div style=\"margin-top: 30px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; width: 170px; margin-left: 100px;\">\n              <div class=\"placeholder portrait\">[Photo: portrait]</div>\n              <div class=\"caption\" style=\"margin-top: 8px;\">\n                Holger Sierks<br>\n                Framing Camera Lead, MPS\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width: 220px; height: 470px; margin-left: 10px; margin-top: 20px;\">\n            [Photo: framing camera instrument hardware]\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"section\">\n        <h2>Gamma Ray Neutron Detector <span class=\"flag flag-us\"></span></h2>\n        <div class=\"row\">\n          <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width: 330px; height: 400px; margin-right: 14px;\">\n            [Diagram: GRaND instrument cutaway]\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"flex: 1 1 auto;\">\n            <p class=\"body\">\n              GRaND measures elemental abundances on the surfaces of Vesta and Ceres, offering insight into their respective formation and evolution\n            </p>\n            <div style=\"margin-top: 40px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; width: 170px; margin-left: 20px;\">\n              <div class=\"placeholder portrait\">[Photo: portrait]</div>\n              <div class=\"caption\" style=\"margin-top: 8px;\">\n                Tom Prettyman<br>\n                GRaND Team Lead, PSI\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- CENTER COLUMN -->\n    <div class=\"col-center\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width: 620px; height: 900px;\">\n        [Illustration: centered — Dawn spacecraft in red orbital trajectory around protoplanet Vesta, ion thruster plume directed at the body]\n      </div>\n\n      <p class=\"center-para\">\n        In its journey to the main asteroid belt to orbit two diverse protoplanets, Vesta and Ceres, Dawn is carrying a suite of sophisticated scientific instruments to collect data that will inform us about the early formation of our solar system.\n      </p>\n\n      <div class=\"url\">http://dawn.jpl.nasa.gov</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- RIGHT COLUMN -->\n    <div class=\"col-right\">\n\n      <div class=\"section\">\n        <h2>Gravity Science <span class=\"flag flag-us\"></span></h2>\n        <div class=\"row\">\n          <div style=\"flex: 1 1 auto; max-width: 460px;\">\n            <p class=\"body\">\n              Gravity science: the spacecraft transmits a radio signal to Earth through its high gain antenna that changes in frequency as the spacecraft's speed changes when flying over areas of different densities. The collective set of information on the mass variations or concentrations is called the gravitational field of the body/planet.\n            </p>\n            <div style=\"margin-top: 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; width: 170px; margin-left: 260px;\">\n              <div class=\"placeholder portrait\">[Photo: portrait]</div>\n              <div class=\"caption\" style=\"margin-top: 8px;\">\n                Sami Asmar<br>\n                Gravity Science Lead, JPL\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width: 330px; height: 400px; margin-left: 10px;\">\n            [Photo: high gain antenna and solar array panel]\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"section\">\n        <h2 style=\"text-align: right;\">Visible &amp; Infrared Spectrometer <span class=\"flag flag-it\"></span></h2>\n        <div class=\"row\">\n          <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width: 380px; height: 380px; margin-right: 14px;\">\n            [Photo: VIR spectrometer instrument]\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"flex: 1 1 auto;\">\n            <p class=\"body right-text\">\n              VIR measures reflected sunlight and emitted thermal radiation from the surfaces of the targets. Scientists extract and then map mineralogical signatures and thermal properties. These properties hold clues to the history and formation mechanisms of Vesta and Ceres.\n            </p>\n            <div style=\"margin-top: 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; width: 170px; margin-left: auto;\">\n              <div class=\"placeholder portrait\">[Photo: portrait]</div>\n              <div class=\"caption\" style=\"margin-top: 8px;\">\n                Angioletta Coradini,<br>\n                VIR Team Leader, INAF\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
